Third party components

netmusic links two pure-Go libraries that keep their own licenses; they are NOT
covered by the CC BY-SA license above:

  * github.com/hajimehoshi/go-mp3   — ISC License
  * github.com/skip2/go-qrcode      — MIT License

See THIRD-PARTY.md for the exact texts and links.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on license choice

Creative Commons itself recommends against using CC licenses for software,
because they do not address patents and because ShareAlike is awkward to apply
to compiled binaries and source trees. This project follows the copyright
holder's explicit choice of CC BY-SA 4.0. If you need a software-specific
license instead, MIT or Apache-2.0 would be the usual pick.
